<ptxt>When using SST (TaSCAN) with the IG OFF, repeatedly turn any door courtesy light switch ON ←→ OFF until communication between TaSCAN and the vehicle starts. (ON←→OFF interval within 1.5 seconds)</ptxt>
</atten3>
